WEBVTT

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:08.768
Thank you.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.130
Iroha-sama, thank you for coming back safely.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:54.680
It's not my power alone.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.100
It's because the Kirarin Rabbit lent me his power.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:09.000
I'm going to borrow the power of my friends and show off my power.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.900
It's really a friendly tact.

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.190
If we all work together, there's nothing we can't do.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.580
I haven't put my strength together.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.670
What's wrong?

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.120
Friendly tact.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:25.340
Why couldn't I use wheat?

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.060
Well...

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:27.620
Why?

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.030
What?

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:31.850
I wonder why...

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:32.890
Hmm...

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.420
I got a tact, but I can't use it.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:36.840
This is an easy situation.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:41.490
As a Precure, something very important is missing!

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.560
I can't! I'll fight with Iroha!

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:41.720
Is there anything itchy, customer?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.730
There's a lot more...

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:45.840
Here, right?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:46.880
Wahoo!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.850
Shake hands!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:50.660
Pan!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.890
Well done!

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:57.140
Here, as a reward!

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.090
It's so good!

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.930
I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.960
It's so good!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.140
Ah! The wheat!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:12.610
It looks so good!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.480
It's so good!

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.440
Mom, what about your work at the hospital?

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:19.920
I'm waiting for the patient.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.040
Oh, he's just arrived.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:32.450
Hello, Inui-san, Choco-chan.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.900
I'm sorry, teacher. I'm late.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.420
This girl doesn't like it.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.820
Choco-chan, don't go wild.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.020
Ah, be careful not to fall.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:46.520
I can't get a preventive shot with this, can I?

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:48.500
I'm sorry. I'll go out again.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.320
Wait a minute.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.760
Hello, Choco-chan.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.060
What's wrong?

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.340
Are you worried?

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.480
The hospital is nervous, isn't it?

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.890
But...

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.510
It's okay. Choco-chan won't get sick.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:07.860
Inui-san is with us, so I'll go with you if it's okay.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:12.560
Let's do our best together.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.380
Iroha-chan, you're amazing.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:18.100
Even though Choco is very shy...

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:19.360
No, no.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.500
Thank you, Iroha.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.020
It's been a long time.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:27.990
All the timid and scared kids are close to Iroha.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.660
I just want to be friends with everyone, that's all I want to do.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.180
Wafu...

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:46.340
Komugi, I'm sorry.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.120
If you make a fuss, Choco-chan will get scared.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:51.630
Wait for me at home for a bit.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.860
Mayu, I'm calling you

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:27.520
Mayu, do you want to play?

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.450
Mayu, your dad is calling you.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:41.820
Mayu, it's been a while. How are you?

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.850
I'm fine.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.440
Dad, where are you now?

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.010
I'm in Tanzania on the African continent.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.570
I'm chasing a lion.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:53.250
It's the picture I took today.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:58.740
This lion is powerful.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.080
It looks strong and cool!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:02.340
That's right.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:08.220
The lion's mane is very beautiful when it shines in the strong sunlight.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:14.420
Screams echo throughout the grassland and inside the body.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.330
I'm impressed and amazed.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.920
Dad looks so much fun.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.230
It's fun to be able to see your favorite animals up close.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.950
How about Mayu? Has school started?

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:31.170
From next week...

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.390
You already have a friend named Iroha-chan, don't you?

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:35.350
Right?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.830
A friend?

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:41.230
Mayu will be fine as she is.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.360
Enjoy the new school.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:55.220
What's wrong?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.010
I want to help Iroha with the wheat.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:07:59.070
Help?

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.290
So...

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.930
Go ahead and get it!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:09.830
Good, good, good!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.040
Huh?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:18.350
I'm sorry, but I don't want to...

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:22.130
Then...

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:25.180
Please go to bed with me!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.080
That's not it...

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:36.280
Good night, wheat.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:59.020
Did you eat it?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:02.690
I got a lead.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.790
I liked that lead.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:19.220
But I can't help it.

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:20.580
I'll borrow another lead.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.750
It should have been in my father's salon.

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:24.930
No!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.110
Huh?

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:39.580
Even though I chose it with you, I've been walking around with it for a long time.

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.630
I hate it if it's not this lead.

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:44.790
It can't be helped because there is no such thing.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.360
The usual is good.

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.040
Don't be selfish!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.060
Well then, today's walk is over!

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:49.820
Nana, what's wrong with Iroha and the wheat?

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.240
Isn't it the first time you haven't taken a morning walk?

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.950
That's right. It's rare.

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:57.600
Did something happen?

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:59.200
No way!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.520
I'm always with you, so sometimes we fight, right?

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.650
Come on, Shigata, Shigata!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:24.550
Look at me! It's dangerous!

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.440
I'm going to hit Saku again!

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:31.790
Did something happen between you and Komugi-chan?

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:32.760
I want to know.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:35.580
N-No, if you don't want to tell me, then I can't.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.140
Listen to me!

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.620
Komugi always says selfish things!

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.620
I don't know how to use tact either!

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.540
I don't know, but I can't tell you what to do!

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:45.920
Isn't that right?!

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.300
Y-You're right.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:50.130
And I've told you many times that I don't have the usual lead!

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.590
I don't like it if it's not like that!

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:52.930
There's nothing I don't have.

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:53.730
Even though I can't do anything impossible!

00:11:54.760 --> 00:11:55.080
...

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:05.880
I thought I could get along with you more if I could talk to you, but I don't want to fight with you.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:10.220
I think that's the same for you, Komugi-chan.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:16.940
You're always working hard for Inukai-san. I want to be useful to you.

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.280
I just want to get along with you.

00:13:14.590 --> 00:13:17.470
Um, it's dangerous to take Daifuku with us.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.020
What should we do?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.980
Let Inukai-san take care of him...

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.060
Daifuku!?

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:25.570
Do you want to go?

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:28.670
Let's go!

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:46.400
What did you say?

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.700
Look, look, it's all right.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:24.670
If such a big girl goes to the town...

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:37.376
Hello!

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:12.060
Let me hear the voice of the chihuahua

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:24.760
The wheat is also free chihuahua

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.300
There's a letter in Gar-Garu!

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:10.670
That's the only one with that feature!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:11.990
That's right.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:13.060
What is it?

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.230
A monster?

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:15.720
It's definitely a lion!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.360
A lion!?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.470
What's a lion?

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.130
You don't know?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.150
Of course I don't know.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.960
In Japan, lions are only seen in zoo.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:26.670
There's no chance of seeing a Wanderer.

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:28.980
Oh, I see.

00:16:30.604 --> 00:16:32.104
Leave it to me!

00:16:32.236 --> 00:16:34.236
I'll chase after any kind of animal!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:12.360
This is probably your instinct.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:18.730
The lion is called the king of the hundred beasts.

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.800
The top of various wild animals.

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:25.920
It is a strong animal that is called the king.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:28.670
Wonderful is afraid of lions.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:30.330
Of course.

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:40.760
Be safe with Satoru-kun and Daifuku-chan.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:42.780
Okay?

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:55.260
I'm Cure Friendly.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.940
I don't worry or hurt you.

00:17:58.480 --> 00:17:59.740
I'm...

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:01.020
You and your friends?

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.080
I don't care!

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:27.510
I don't care!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:32.140
Grade...

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.210
Garu-Garu is

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:18.760
Wonderful, we can't go there!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:19.740
Let's evacuate!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:18.330
He's dead.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.320
I can't be with you forever!

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.840
You were scared and shivering, right?

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:41.130
Rikyuawa!

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:42.580
Don't move!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.500
It's not the time for us to calm down and talk!

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:48.380
Where's GaruGaru?

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.740
He ran into the mountains.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:59.700
A big GaruGaru can be hidden.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.530
The location is limited. I'll try to find it.

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:04.860
If I find something, I'll let you know.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.810
Thank you.

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:09.470
Komugi, I'm going home.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:17.360
Komugi, see you.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:18.640
See you.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:47.450
I can't stand up.

00:21:47.810 --> 00:21:48.480
I'm going to sleep.

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.460
Hello, I'm your friend, Ribe-
